{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202490","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120249001:1":{"text":"…이 사람들이 다 우릴 배웅하는 거라고? 설마 또 싸우려는 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"……你带着这么多人送我们？不会是还想打架吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D66B1DE5E23860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120249002:1":{"text":"신경 쓰지 마. 난 진심으로 배웅하러 온 거니까.","source_cn":"不用在意他们，我是真心实意想送你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC784E8101F669651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120249003:1":{"text":"어쨌든… 예전의 일들은 다 내 탓이었어. 블랙하울의 뜻이 아니야…","source_cn":"诸位，无论如何……一切都是我，黑嚎氏族并没有要跟你们为难……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA59C18EC6CD9AA51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120249004:1":{"text":"…딱히 설득력은 없는 것 같군.","source_cn":"……你这话，可真没说服力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B12677F34443A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120249005:1":{"text":"…적어도 지금부터는 아무도 너희한테 뭐라 하지 않을 거다.","source_cn":"……最起码，从现在开始，不会再有人为难你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49FD574F74BD117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120249006:1":{"text":"긴말은 안 하겠다. 모쪼록 무사하길 바란다!","source_cn":"不说了，诸位，一路顺风！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1681D262999243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:库金":{"text":"쿠긴","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}